<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  usv_boat: simulation model of the team's catamaran USV (DHO Kemalreis, A-1773).

  Started from the VRX roboboat01 model (github.com/osrf/vrx, Apache-2.0); geometry,
  thrusters and physics are now our own.

  Frame: x forward (bow), y left, z up. Origin on the centre line, at the design waterline,
  half way along the hull.

  Sources of the numbers (2026-10-23):
    technical drawing (Sekil 6): length 1.182 m, beam 0.78 m, hull centre lines +/-0.26 m,
      thruster positions, box position
    ROBO27_MAIN_BODY_SIM.STL (SolidWorks, before the build; 2026-10-26): hull shape only -
      length 1.182 m, width 0.247 m at its widest, 0.32 m keel to deck. The hulls are 0.60 m
      apart in that STL; the drawing's +/-0.26 m is kept (0.52 + 0.247 = 0.77 m beam, as
      drawn). The STL hulls float 45 kg in sea water at a draft of ~0.13 m.
    ANSYS VOF images: draft ~0.11-0.13 m (the STL gives ~0.13 m at 45 kg)
    photos (2026-10-23): bow "scoop" profile, blue bow bumper, ZED on the front cross
      profile between the hulls, GNSS mast leaning aft, ducted thrusters on struts
    team: total mass 45 kg; steering +/-45 deg (1100 PWM = 45 deg left, 1900 = 45 deg right);
      thrusters are Degz Utras (M5 motor), one 7S battery per thruster
    Degz Utras product page: 8-11 kgf at 24-25.2 V (sources disagree; rated 3S-6S).
      Used: the conservative 8 kgf at 24 V, scaled with voltage squared to 7S nominal
      25.9 V: 8 * (25.9 / 24)^2 = 9.3 kgf = 91 N. Range if the 11 kgf figure holds: ~114 N.
      Reverse: ASSUMED 70 % = -64 N.
    legacy run video 2026-10-14 (ZED HUD recording, read frame by frame): surge drag
    ASSUMED, to be identified in the field: propeller diameter (0.09 m), centre of gravity
      height, inertia

  Buoyancy: usv_gz_plugins::HullBuoyancy integrates the water pressure over the hull mesh
  (meshes/hull.obj, made from the STL), with the VRX waves, so draft, heave/roll/pitch
  stiffness and reserve buoyancy follow from the real shape. Expected from the STL, sea
  water: 43.6 kg at the origin, so the boat settles ~3 mm below it; heave stiffness ~4 050
  N/m; roll ~290 Nm/rad; pitch ~340 Nm/rad; 128 kg before the hulls go under.
    Replaced (2026-10-26): VRX Surface, which treats each hull as a cylinder and counts at
    most half of it (radius 0.13 m: 50 % too stiff in heave, sank above 63 kg).
  Centre of gravity: x = -0.045 m, over the centre of buoyancy of the STL hulls, i.e. the
  boat ASSUMED to float level. Base link x = -0.044 gives that with the thruster masses.
  With the old x = 0 the hulls would trim ~3 deg bow down.

  Drag (SimpleHydrodynamics). Thrust is taken as linear in PWM: 91 N at 1900 (ASSUMED).
    yaw  nR = 28, nRR = 35: back-calculated from the legacy field measurement in config.py
         (spot turn 35-57 deg/s at SPOT_TURN_PWM 200, i.e. 45.5 N per thruster, 44.6 Nm).
         Check: 140 PWM -> 36 deg/s, legacy measured 22-38 deg/s.
    surge xU = 70.5, xUU = 39.2: 1.28 m/s at CRUISE_PWM 180 (4 x 41 N = 164 N). Fitted
         from the legacy run video of 2026-10-14 (every frame read): on the straight legs
         with all four thrusters at ~1680 (e.g. frames 1069-1186) the GPS track and the
         distance-to-target both give 1.25-1.31 m/s. The previous values (45.5 / 25.3,
         from a config.py comment) gave 1.73 m/s in simulation, ~35 % too fast. Both
         terms scaled by the same factor 1.55, so the shape of the curve is unchanged.
         The HUD "HIZ" (VFR_HUD groundspeed) read 0.3-0.8 on those legs and was NOT used.
         Single heading, wind unknown: confirm with the vehicle CSV.
    yaw check from the same video: +/-156 PWM pure differential (frames 950-975) turned the
         boat at ~33-43 deg/s; this model predicts ~39 deg/s, so nR / nRR are kept.
    sway yV, yVV: 6 x the OLD surge values (a catamaran's side area is ~6x its frontal
         area). Kept when surge was refitted: the turning behaviour was already checked.
         The first model had sway = surge (inherited from roboboat01) and slid sideways
         instead of turning.
    heave/roll/pitch damping: first guesses (with the new stiffness: heave ~10 % of
         critical, roll ~90 %, pitch overdamped); to be checked against the real boat.

  Steering sign (measured in simulation): positive angle (counter-clockwise from above) on a
  FRONT thruster turns the boat LEFT. So 1900 PWM (team: thrusters right, boat turns right)
  maps to -0.785 rad.

  Visuals: hull mesh made from the STL by scripts/make_hull_mesh.py (meshes/hull.obj, ~8 000
  triangles, deck at z = +0.19, keel at z = -0.13 = the computed draft, so the drawn
  waterline matches the real one); everything else primitive shapes, placed from the
  photos. Collisions are simple boxes around each hull. The same mesh carries the buoyancy.

  ZED camera (for the future sensor): x = +0.29, y = 0, z = +0.18, facing forward.

  Gazebo topics (gz.msgs.Double):
    /usv_boat/thrusters/{rear_left,rear_right,front_left,front_right}/thrust   N
    /usv_boat/thrusters/{front_left,front_right}/pos                             rad, + = CCW seen from above
    /usv_boat/navsat     gz.msgs.NavSat    GNSS antenna on the mast, 10 Hz, exact
    /usv_boat/imu        gz.msgs.IMU       orientation in ENU, 50 Hz, exact
    /usv_boat/odometry   gz.msgs.Odometry  velocity for the ground speed, 50 Hz, exact
    /usv_boat/magnetometer gz.msgs.Magnetometer  ZED 2i magnetometer, 50 Hz, exact
-->
<sdf version="1.6">
  <model name="usv_boat">

    <!-- ================= Hull, deck, superstructure ================= -->
    <link name="base_link">
      <inertial>
        <!-- 45 kg total minus 4 x (0.5 kg housing + 0.05 kg propeller); x: see header -->
        <pose>-0.044 0 0.05 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>42.8</mass>
        <inertia>
          <!-- Solid box 1.18 x 0.78 x 0.5 m: a rough first estimate -->
          <ixx>3.06</ixx>
          <ixy>0</ixy>
          <ixz>0</ixz>
          <iyy>5.86</iyy>
          <iyz>0</iyz>
          <izz>7.14</izz>
        </inertia>
      </inertial>

      <!-- Hulls (mesh) -->
      <visual name="left_hull_visual">
        <pose>0 0.26 0 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><mesh><uri>file://usv_boat/meshes/hull.obj</uri></mesh></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.55 0.57 0.60 1</ambient><diffuse>0.62 0.64 0.67 1</diffuse><specular>0.3 0.3 0.3 1</specular></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="right_hull_visual">
        <pose>0 -0.26 0 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><mesh><uri>file://usv_boat/meshes/hull.obj</uri></mesh></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.55 0.57 0.60 1</ambient><diffuse>0.62 0.64 0.67 1</diffuse><specular>0.3 0.3 0.3 1</specular></material>
      </visual>

      <!-- Hatch lids on top of the hulls -->
      <visual name="left_front_lid">
        <pose>0.10 0.26 0.20 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.36 0.17 0.02</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.6 0.62 0.65 1</ambient><diffuse>0.68 0.70 0.73 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="right_front_lid">
        <pose>0.10 -0.26 0.20 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.36 0.17 0.02</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.6 0.62 0.65 1</ambient><diffuse>0.68 0.70 0.73 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="left_rear_lid">
        <pose>-0.40 0.26 0.20 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.24 0.17 0.02</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.6 0.62 0.65 1</ambient><diffuse>0.68 0.70 0.73 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="right_rear_lid">
        <pose>-0.40 -0.26 0.20 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.24 0.17 0.02</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.6 0.62 0.65 1</ambient><diffuse>0.68 0.70 0.73 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>

      <!-- Aluminium cross profiles (front one carries the ZED) -->
      <visual name="front_profile">
        <pose>0.27 0 0.205 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.04 0.74 0.03</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.7 0.7 0.72 1</ambient><diffuse>0.8 0.8 0.82 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="rear_profile">
        <pose>-0.47 0 0.205 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.04 0.74 0.03</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.7 0.7 0.72 1</ambient><diffuse>0.8 0.8 0.82 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>

      <!-- Electronics box: beige body, aluminium lid -->
      <visual name="box_body">
        <pose>-0.10 0 0.30 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.66 0.52 0.18</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.72 0.71 0.62 1</ambient><diffuse>0.82 0.81 0.72 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="box_lid">
        <pose>-0.10 0 0.43 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.70 0.55 0.08</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.72 0.73 0.75 1</ambient><diffuse>0.82 0.83 0.85 1</diffuse><specular>0.6 0.6 0.6 1</specular></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="estop">
        <pose>-0.44 0.12 0.32 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.02</radius><length>0.03</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.7 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.85 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>

      <!-- ZED 2i on the front profile, facing forward -->
      <visual name="zed">
        <pose>0.29 0 0.18 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.03 0.175 0.033</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>

      <!-- Blue bow bumper and its two struts back to the front profile -->
      <visual name="bumper">
        <pose>0.63 0 0.10 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.04 0.80 0.05</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.08 0.18 0.65 1</ambient><diffuse>0.12 0.25 0.85 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="bumper_strut_left">
        <pose>0.45 0.13 0.15 0 0.278 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.37 0.03 0.03</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.08 0.18 0.65 1</ambient><diffuse>0.12 0.25 0.85 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="bumper_strut_right">
        <pose>0.45 -0.13 0.15 0 0.278 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.37 0.03 0.03</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.08 0.18 0.65 1</ambient><diffuse>0.12 0.25 0.85 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>

      <!-- GNSS mast leaning aft, antenna on top -->
      <visual name="mast">
        <pose>-0.525 0 0.51 0 -0.343 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.012</radius><length>0.45</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.7 0.7 0.72 1</ambient><diffuse>0.8 0.8 0.82 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="gnss">
        <pose>-0.60 0 0.735 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.045</radius><length>0.03</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>

      <!-- Collisions: simple boxes -->
      <collision name="left_hull_collision">
        <pose>0 0.26 0.03 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>1.182 0.247 0.32</size></box></geometry>
      </collision>
      <collision name="right_hull_collision">
        <pose>0 -0.26 0.03 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>1.182 0.247 0.32</size></box></geometry>
      </collision>
      <collision name="box_collision">
        <pose>-0.10 0 0.34 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.70 0.55 0.26</size></box></geometry>
      </collision>
      <collision name="bumper_collision">
        <pose>0.63 0 0.10 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.04 0.80 0.05</size></box></geometry>
      </collision>

      <!-- Sensors: exact values; sim_bridge adds the real sensors' rates, delays and errors -->
      <!-- GNSS antenna on top of the mast, so rolling and pitching move it as on the boat -->
      <sensor name="navsat" type="navsat">
        <pose>-0.60 0 0.75 0 0 0</pose>
        <always_on>1</always_on>
        <update_rate>10</update_rate>
        <topic>/usv_boat/navsat</topic>
      </sensor>
      <!-- Attitude and heading reference (the Orange Cube sits in the box) -->
      <sensor name="imu" type="imu">
        <pose>-0.10 0 0.30 0 0 0</pose>
        <always_on>1</always_on>
        <update_rate>50</update_rate>
        <topic>/usv_boat/imu</topic>
        <imu>
          <orientation_reference_frame><localization>ENU</localization></orientation_reference_frame>
        </imu>
      </sensor>
      <!-- Magnetometer of the ZED 2i, in the camera; the field comes from the world -->
      <sensor name="zed_magnetometer" type="magnetometer">
        <pose>0.29 0 0.18 0 0 0</pose>
        <always_on>1</always_on>
        <update_rate>50</update_rate>
        <topic>/usv_boat/magnetometer</topic>
      </sensor>
    </link>

    <!-- Exact velocity for /usv/speed (GPS Doppler on the boat); the pose is not used -->
    <plugin filename="gz-sim-odometry-publisher-system"
            name="gz::sim::systems::OdometryPublisher">
      <odom_topic>/usv_boat/odometry</odom_topic>
      <odom_publish_frequency>50</odom_publish_frequency>
      <dimensions>3</dimensions>
    </plugin>

    <!-- ================= Thrusters =================
         Positions: front x = +0.363 (0.228 m behind the bow), rear x = -0.493
         (0.098 m ahead of the transom), y = +/-0.245, z = -0.178 (7 cm below the hull bottom).
         Each thruster: housing link (strut, duct, hub) + propeller link.
         Front housings rotate about z. -->

    <!-- Front left -->
    <link name="front_left_housing_link">
      <inertial>
        <pose>0.363 0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>0.5</mass>
        <inertia><ixx>0.0004</ixx><ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyy>0.0008</iyy><iyz>0</iyz><izz>0.0008</izz></inertia>
      </inertial>
      <visual name="strut">
        <pose>0.363 0.245 -0.115 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.04 0.02 0.08</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="duct">
        <pose>0.363 0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.055</radius><length>0.07</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="hub">
        <pose>0.40 0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.022</radius><length>0.10</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
    </link>
    <link name="front_left_prop_link">
      <inertial>
        <pose>0.33 0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>0.05</mass>
        <inertia><ixx>0.000051</ixx><ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyy>0.000027</iyy><iyz>0</iyz><izz>0.000027</izz></inertia>
      </inertial>
      <visual name="visual">
        <pose>0.33 0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.045</radius><length>0.01</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.6 0.1 0.15 1</ambient><diffuse>0.75 0.15 0.2 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
    </link>
    <joint name="front_left_steer_joint" type="revolute">
      <pose>0.363 0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
      <parent>base_link</parent>
      <child>front_left_housing_link</child>
      <axis>
        <xyz>0 0 1</xyz>
        <limit><lower>-0.785</lower><upper>0.785</upper><effort>10</effort><velocity>10</velocity></limit>
      </axis>
    </joint>
    <joint name="front_left_prop_joint" type="revolute">
      <pose>0.33 0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
      <parent>front_left_housing_link</parent>
      <child>front_left_prop_link</child>
      <axis>
        <xyz>1 0 0</xyz>
        <limit><effort>100</effort><velocity>1000</velocity></limit>
        <dynamics><friction>0.05</friction><damping>0.05</damping></dynamics>
      </axis>
    </joint>

    <!-- Front right -->
    <link name="front_right_housing_link">
      <inertial>
        <pose>0.363 -0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>0.5</mass>
        <inertia><ixx>0.0004</ixx><ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyy>0.0008</iyy><iyz>0</iyz><izz>0.0008</izz></inertia>
      </inertial>
      <visual name="strut">
        <pose>0.363 -0.245 -0.115 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.04 0.02 0.08</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="duct">
        <pose>0.363 -0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.055</radius><length>0.07</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="hub">
        <pose>0.40 -0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.022</radius><length>0.10</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
    </link>
    <link name="front_right_prop_link">
      <inertial>
        <pose>0.33 -0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>0.05</mass>
        <inertia><ixx>0.000051</ixx><ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyy>0.000027</iyy><iyz>0</iyz><izz>0.000027</izz></inertia>
      </inertial>
      <visual name="visual">
        <pose>0.33 -0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.045</radius><length>0.01</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.6 0.1 0.15 1</ambient><diffuse>0.75 0.15 0.2 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
    </link>
    <joint name="front_right_steer_joint" type="revolute">
      <pose>0.363 -0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
      <parent>base_link</parent>
      <child>front_right_housing_link</child>
      <axis>
        <xyz>0 0 1</xyz>
        <limit><lower>-0.785</lower><upper>0.785</upper><effort>10</effort><velocity>10</velocity></limit>
      </axis>
    </joint>
    <joint name="front_right_prop_joint" type="revolute">
      <pose>0.33 -0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
      <parent>front_right_housing_link</parent>
      <child>front_right_prop_link</child>
      <axis>
        <xyz>1 0 0</xyz>
        <limit><effort>100</effort><velocity>1000</velocity></limit>
        <dynamics><friction>0.05</friction><damping>0.05</damping></dynamics>
      </axis>
    </joint>

    <!-- Rear left (fixed) -->
    <link name="rear_left_housing_link">
      <inertial>
        <pose>-0.493 0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>0.5</mass>
        <inertia><ixx>0.0004</ixx><ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyy>0.0008</iyy><iyz>0</iyz><izz>0.0008</izz></inertia>
      </inertial>
      <visual name="strut">
        <pose>-0.493 0.245 -0.12 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.04 0.02 0.07</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="duct">
        <pose>-0.493 0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.055</radius><length>0.07</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="hub">
        <pose>-0.456 0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.022</radius><length>0.10</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
    </link>
    <link name="rear_left_prop_link">
      <inertial>
        <pose>-0.526 0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>0.05</mass>
        <inertia><ixx>0.000051</ixx><ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyy>0.000027</iyy><iyz>0</iyz><izz>0.000027</izz></inertia>
      </inertial>
      <visual name="visual">
        <pose>-0.526 0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.045</radius><length>0.01</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.6 0.1 0.15 1</ambient><diffuse>0.75 0.15 0.2 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
    </link>
    <joint name="rear_left_mount_joint" type="fixed">
      <parent>base_link</parent>
      <child>rear_left_housing_link</child>
    </joint>
    <joint name="rear_left_prop_joint" type="revolute">
      <pose>-0.526 0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
      <parent>rear_left_housing_link</parent>
      <child>rear_left_prop_link</child>
      <axis>
        <xyz>1 0 0</xyz>
        <limit><effort>100</effort><velocity>1000</velocity></limit>
        <dynamics><friction>0.05</friction><damping>0.05</damping></dynamics>
      </axis>
    </joint>

    <!-- Rear right (fixed) -->
    <link name="rear_right_housing_link">
      <inertial>
        <pose>-0.493 -0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>0.5</mass>
        <inertia><ixx>0.0004</ixx><ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyy>0.0008</iyy><iyz>0</iyz><izz>0.0008</izz></inertia>
      </inertial>
      <visual name="strut">
        <pose>-0.493 -0.245 -0.12 0 0 0</pose>
        <geometry><box><size>0.04 0.02 0.07</size></box></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="duct">
        <pose>-0.493 -0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.055</radius><length>0.07</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
      <visual name="hub">
        <pose>-0.456 -0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.022</radius><length>0.10</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.05 0.05 0.05 1</ambient><diffuse>0.1 0.1 0.1 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
    </link>
    <link name="rear_right_prop_link">
      <inertial>
        <pose>-0.526 -0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
        <mass>0.05</mass>
        <inertia><ixx>0.000051</ixx><ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyy>0.000027</iyy><iyz>0</iyz><izz>0.000027</izz></inertia>
      </inertial>
      <visual name="visual">
        <pose>-0.526 -0.245 -0.178 0 1.5708 0</pose>
        <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.045</radius><length>0.01</length></cylinder></geometry>
        <material><ambient>0.6 0.1 0.15 1</ambient><diffuse>0.75 0.15 0.2 1</diffuse></material>
      </visual>
    </link>
    <joint name="rear_right_mount_joint" type="fixed">
      <parent>base_link</parent>
      <child>rear_right_housing_link</child>
    </joint>
    <joint name="rear_right_prop_joint" type="revolute">
      <pose>-0.526 -0.245 -0.178 0 0 0</pose>
      <parent>rear_right_housing_link</parent>
      <child>rear_right_prop_link</child>
      <axis>
        <xyz>1 0 0</xyz>
        <limit><effort>100</effort><velocity>1000</velocity></limit>
        <dynamics><friction>0.05</friction><damping>0.05</damping></dynamics>
      </axis>
    </joint>

    <!-- ================= Buoyancy: water pressure on the hull mesh (usv_gz_plugins) ================= -->
    <plugin filename="UsvHullBuoyancy" name="usv_gz_plugins::HullBuoyancy">
      <link_name>base_link</link_name>
      <mesh>file://usv_boat/meshes/hull.obj</mesh>
      <hull_offset>0 0.26 0</hull_offset>
      <hull_offset>0 -0.26 0</hull_offset>
      <fluid_density>1025</fluid_density>
      <fluid_level>0</fluid_level>
      <report_period>5</report_period>
      <wavefield><topic>/vrx/wavefield/parameters</topic></wavefield>
    </plugin>

    <!-- ================= Drag (VRX) - see header for sources ================= -->
    <plugin filename="libSimpleHydrodynamics.so" name="vrx::SimpleHydrodynamics">
      <link_name>base_link</link_name>
      <xDotU>0.0</xDotU>
      <yDotV>0.0</yDotV>
      <nDotR>0.0</nDotR>
      <xU>70.5</xU>
      <xUU>39.2</xUU>
      <yV>273.0</yV>
      <yVV>152.0</yVV>
      <zW>90.0</zW>
      <kP>54.0</kP>
      <kPP>108.0</kPP>
      <mQ>162.0</mQ>
      <mQQ>157.5</mQQ>
      <nR>28.0</nR>
      <nRR>35.0</nRR>
    </plugin>

    <!-- ================= Thrust: Degz Utras on 7S, 91 N forward (see header) ================= -->
    <plugin filename="gz-sim-thruster-system" name="gz::sim::systems::Thruster">
      <namespace>usv_boat</namespace>
      <topic>thrusters/front_left/thrust</topic>
      <joint_name>front_left_prop_joint</joint_name>
      <thrust_coefficient>0.004422</thrust_coefficient>
      <fluid_density>1000</fluid_density>
      <propeller_diameter>0.09</propeller_diameter>
      <velocity_control>true</velocity_control>
      <max_thrust_cmd>91</max_thrust_cmd>
      <min_thrust_cmd>-64</min_thrust_cmd>
    </plugin>
    <plugin filename="gz-sim-thruster-system" name="gz::sim::systems::Thruster">
      <namespace>usv_boat</namespace>
      <topic>thrusters/front_right/thrust</topic>
      <joint_name>front_right_prop_joint</joint_name>
      <thrust_coefficient>0.004422</thrust_coefficient>
      <fluid_density>1000</fluid_density>
      <propeller_diameter>0.09</propeller_diameter>
      <velocity_control>true</velocity_control>
      <max_thrust_cmd>91</max_thrust_cmd>
      <min_thrust_cmd>-64</min_thrust_cmd>
    </plugin>
    <plugin filename="gz-sim-thruster-system" name="gz::sim::systems::Thruster">
      <namespace>usv_boat</namespace>
      <topic>thrusters/rear_left/thrust</topic>
      <joint_name>rear_left_prop_joint</joint_name>
      <thrust_coefficient>0.004422</thrust_coefficient>
      <fluid_density>1000</fluid_density>
      <propeller_diameter>0.09</propeller_diameter>
      <velocity_control>true</velocity_control>
      <max_thrust_cmd>91</max_thrust_cmd>
      <min_thrust_cmd>-64</min_thrust_cmd>
    </plugin>
    <plugin filename="gz-sim-thruster-system" name="gz::sim::systems::Thruster">
      <namespace>usv_boat</namespace>
      <topic>thrusters/rear_right/thrust</topic>
      <joint_name>rear_right_prop_joint</joint_name>
      <thrust_coefficient>0.004422</thrust_coefficient>
      <fluid_density>1000</fluid_density>
      <propeller_diameter>0.09</propeller_diameter>
      <velocity_control>true</velocity_control>
      <max_thrust_cmd>91</max_thrust_cmd>
      <min_thrust_cmd>-64</min_thrust_cmd>
    </plugin>

    <!-- ================= Front thruster steering ================= -->
    <plugin filename="gz-sim-joint-position-controller-system"
            name="gz::sim::systems::JointPositionController">
      <joint_name>front_left_steer_joint</joint_name>
      <use_velocity_commands>true</use_velocity_commands>
      <topic>/usv_boat/thrusters/front_left/pos</topic>
    </plugin>
    <plugin filename="gz-sim-joint-position-controller-system"
            name="gz::sim::systems::JointPositionController">
      <joint_name>front_right_steer_joint</joint_name>
      <use_velocity_commands>true</use_velocity_commands>
      <topic>/usv_boat/thrusters/front_right/pos</topic>
    </plugin>

  </model>
</sdf>
